{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "GEN",
  "chapter": 20,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abraham journeyed from thence towards the south country, and dwelt between Kadash and Shur, and sojourned in Gerar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abraham said of Sarah his wife, she is my sister: And Abimelech king of Gerar sent and took Sarah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But God came to Abimelech in a dream by night, and said to him, Behold, thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a dead man, on account of the woman whom thou hast taken: for she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a man's wife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But Abimelech had not come near her: and he said, LORD, wilt thou also slay a righteous nation?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Said he not to me, She ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my sister? and she, even she herself said, He ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my brother: in the integrity of my heart, and innocence of my hands have I done this.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God said to him in a dream, Yea, I know that thou didst this in the integrity of thy heart; for I also withheld thee from sinning against me: therefore I suffered thee not to touch her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now therefore restore to the man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wife, for he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a prophet, and he shall pray for thee, and thou shalt live: and if thou shalt not restore ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", know thou that thou shalt surely die, thou and all that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore Abimelech rose early in the morning, and called all his servants, and told all these things in their ears: and the men were greatly afraid.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Abimelech called Abraham, and said to him, What has thou done to us? and in what have I offended thee, that thou hast brought on me and on my kingdom a great sin? thou hast done deeds to me that ought not to be done.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech said to Abraham, What sawest thou, that thou hast done this thing?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abraham said, Because I thought, surely the fear of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in this place; and they will slay me for my wife's sake.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And yet indeed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "she is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my sister: she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the daughter of my father, but not the daughter of my mother; and she became my wife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when God caused me to wander from my father's house, that I said to her, This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy kindness which thou shalt show to me; At every place whither we shall come, say of me, He ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my brother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech took sheep, and oxen, and men-servants, and women-servants, and gave ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Abraham, and restored to him Sarah his wife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech said, Behold, my land ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before thee: dwell where it pleaseth thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to Sarah he said, Behold, I have given thy brother a thousand ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "pieces",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of silver: behold, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to thee a covering of the eyes, to all that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with thee, and with all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": thus she was reproved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So Abraham prayed to God: and God healed Abimelech, and his wife, and his maid-servants, and they bore ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "children",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.20.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.20.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD had made barren all the females of the house of Abimelech, because of Sarah, Abraham's wife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
